==============================================================
HTTP/1.1 201 Created
Date: REGEX(.*)
Location: /ngsi-ld/v1/csourceSubscriptions/urn:ngsi-ld:Subscription:CSR3
Content-Length: REGEX(\d+)




09. DELETE CSR-sub CSR1 - 204
=============================
HTTP/1.1 204 No Content
Date: REGEX(.*)




